{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30235","headline":"九日嘉州发军亭即事 · 薛逢","name":"九日嘉州发军亭即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三江分注界平沙，何处云山是我家？\n无鹤洲中翻白浪，掬金滩上折黄花。\n不愁故国归无日，却恨浮名苦有涯。\n向暮洒酣宾客散，水天狼籍变余霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}